WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:13.202
Something smashed through the wall of the bank.

2
00:00:13.202 --> 00:00:16.583
Something smashed through the wall of the bank.

3
00:00:16.584 --> 00:00:19.172
Roxy stood in front of Detective Smith.

4
00:00:19.172 --> 00:00:22.353
Bricks and rubble bounced off her.

5
00:00:22.353 --> 00:00:26.812
When the dust cleared, Roxy saw a huge man on the sidewalk.

6
00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:29.584
His body was covered in armor.

7
00:00:29.584 --> 00:00:33.853
The armor on his back was huge and round, like a turtle shell.

8
00:00:33.853 --> 00:00:37.030
The man held a large bag.

9
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:41.651
Using her x-ray vision, Roxy saw money inside the bag.

10
00:00:41.651 --> 00:00:43.991
Hank Tank had spotted Roxy.

11
00:00:43.991 --> 00:00:48.740
"Rocket Girl!" he shouted. "You'll never stop me!"

12
00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.656
Roxy glared at the villain.

13
00:00:50.656 --> 00:00:53.201
"Yes, I will, Hank Tank!"

14
00:00:53.202 --> 00:00:57.918
"Never!" Hank Tank turned to run.

15
00:00:57.919 --> 00:01:00.769
Then he saw all the police cars in his way.

16
00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.159
He pressed a button on his chest.

17
00:01:03.159 --> 00:01:08.533
"Tank mode!" he shouted.

18
00:01:08.533 --> 00:01:10.367
His armor rumbled.

19
00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:13.731
Parts shifted and moved.

20
00:01:13.731 --> 00:01:16.820
Rubber tank treads popped out.

21
00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:20.131
Hank was now a rolling army tank!

22
00:01:20.131 --> 00:01:24.332
"Uh-oh!" cried Detective Smith.

23
00:01:24.332 --> 00:01:29.234
"I guess this is why he stole that army tank," said Roxy.

24
00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:33.485
"He used it to turn himself into a tank!"

25
00:01:33.485 --> 00:01:39.240
Brumm, brumm, brumm! Chug, chug, chug!

26
00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.414
Hank Tank rolled over the police cars.

27
00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:48.432
Crunch! Metal twisted. Windows shattered.

28
00:01:48.432 --> 00:01:53.518
"Ha-ha!" The villain laughed as he rolled down the street.

29
00:01:53.518 --> 00:01:55.508
He rolled over a mailbox.

30
00:01:55.508 --> 00:02:02.587
Crunch! He rolled over a hot dog stand. Smash!

31
00:02:02.587 --> 00:02:09.478
"My hot dogs are ruined!" cried the hot dog man.

32
00:02:09.478 --> 00:02:13.269
"I have to stop Hank Tank!" thought Roxy.

33
00:02:13.277 --> 00:02:17.404
She fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

34
00:02:17.404 --> 00:02:20.207
The beams hit Hank Tank's shell.

35
00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:22.961
But they bounced off and hit a billboard.

36
00:02:22.962 --> 00:02:25.375
The billboard exploded.

37
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:27.909
"Oops!" said Roxy.

38
00:02:27.909 --> 00:02:35.686
"My armor is too strong for your laser beams, Rocket Girl!" shouted Hank.

39
00:02:35.686 --> 00:02:42.486
Bash! Crunch! Hank drove over more cars and then a taxi.

40
00:02:42.486 --> 00:02:45.145
Roxy flew toward Hank fast.

41
00:02:45.145 --> 00:02:47.416
She held out her fist.

42
00:02:47.416 --> 00:02:53.428
Bam! Hank slid across the street and knocked over a traffic light.

43
00:02:53.428 --> 00:02:57.921
"Hit me as hard as you want, Rocket Girl," said Hank Tank.

44
00:02:57.921 --> 00:03:02.815
"You'll never break my armor!"

45
00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:05.918
"Grr!" Roxy stomped her foot.

46
00:03:05.918 --> 00:03:10.601
Then she flew at Hank again and again. Bam! Bam!

47
00:03:10.602 --> 00:03:14.018
But Hank Tank kept rolling along.

48
00:03:14.018 --> 00:03:17.852
"Hank's armor is really strong!" thought Roxy.

49
00:03:17.852 --> 00:03:20.385
"How will I stop him?"

50
00:03:20.386 --> 00:03:23.800
Hank spun around and fired a rocket at Roxy.

51
00:03:23.799 --> 00:03:26.504
Roxy caught it and broke it in half.

52
00:03:26.504 --> 00:03:28.151
"Ha!" said Roxy.

53
00:03:28.151 --> 00:03:30.583
"You might have strong armor, Hank.

54
00:03:30.583 --> 00:03:35.743
But I am Rocket Girl! Nothing can hurt—oof!"

55
00:03:35.743 --> 00:03:38.106
A second rocket hit Roxy.

56
00:03:38.106 --> 00:03:40.399
She fell down with a thud.

57
00:03:40.399 --> 00:03:43.230
Hank Tank sped toward her.

58
00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:51.718
"I'm going to run right over you, Rocket Girl!"
